  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Notifications Panel",
    "Description",
    "Panel listing user notifications — system alerts, @mentions, assignment changes. Opens from the topbar bell icon. Draft — awaiting 2+ consumer alignment.",
    "Sub-components",
    "Notifications Panel   Panel container with header, filters, list, empty state.\nNotification Item     Per-row entry — read / unread state.",
    "Grouping",
    "Group by date: Today, Earlier this week, Earlier.\nWithin groups, order newest first.\nShow unread count badge on the topbar bell when > 0.",
    "Item read state",
    "read=false   Leading unread dot. Full-emphasis text.\nread=true    No dot. Secondary-emphasis text, slightly reduced.\nMark read on click or on panel close (per product).",
    "Labels & Content",
    "Actor avatar + primary text + Timestamp.\nPrimary text: what happened, in user-readable voice ('Alex assigned you a task').\nOptional action button for 1-click resolution ('View', 'Reply').",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Group by date\nDO   Show unread badge on topbar bell\nDO   Mark read on click or panel close\nDO   Offer 1-click action where possible",
    "DON'T   Use for transient outcomes (use Toast)\nDON'T   Show > 1 action per item\nDON'T   Auto-clear read items before user dismiss\nDON'T   Mix product-level and system alerts without labels"
  ],
